# Code owners for the release path.
#
# REPLACE @YOUR-ORG/release-maintainers with a real team before relying on
# this file: an unresolved handle matches nobody, so a required-review
# ruleset built on it would match zero reviewers and never be satisfiable.
# Until then, treat these paths as review-by-hand.
#
# Rationale: these three paths together decide what leaves the repository
# and under what signature -- the release workflow (contents:write,
# id-token:write), the artifact/signing manifest, and the enterprise
# install/uninstall scripts that write service config and ACLs on the host.

/.github/workflows/release.yml @YOUR-ORG/release-maintainers
/.goreleaser.yaml @YOUR-ORG/release-maintainers
/installer/ @YOUR-ORG/release-maintainers
